# Copy to .env.local if you ever need one. Never commit .env.local.
# Variables WITHOUT the NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix are server-only (route handlers).
#
# The app needs NO environment variables to run: there is no backend for health data.
# The only external API is the optional wearable connection below (Google Health,
# read-only, called from the parent's browser; the data stays on the device).
# Do not add a variable without Alberto's approval.

# Optional: wearable connection in the parent's browser (Settings > Child's wearable).
# Public OAuth client ID (Web application) from Google Cloud. It is NOT a secret. Never add a client secret.
# Without it the "Connect wearable" button is disabled and "Use demo data" still works.
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
